WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
Why, hello, you.

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:03.169
Welcome to Clover Grove.

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:12.137
I had the idea for this project.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:13.430
that was kind and sincere.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:17.017
I like to think that I can reach younger audiences,

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.560
because I'm goofy.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.310
I'm silly.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.731
And I want to maximize that and use it to our advantage

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:26.943
while imbuing these messages of kindness and compassion

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:27.819
within our episodes.

00:00:27.902 --> 00:00:31.906
Through Apple and 9 Story, we approached Dr. Junlei Li

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:35.410
to be a kindness and human connection consultant.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.747
I'm trained as a developmental psychologist.

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:43.251
Right now, I am a professor in early childhood at the Graduate

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:45.670
School of Education at Harvard University,

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.255
consulting on Hello, Jack!

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.256
The Kindness Show.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:51.384
Dr. Li's participation has just been invaluable.

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:54.387
I wanted to also put my own unique spin on it.

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:54.888
Boop.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:55.388
Boop.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.806
Tada!

00:00:56.806 --> 00:01:00.351
The hummingbird has become kind of our unofficial mascot

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.436
here in Clover Grove.

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:06.232
We like them to indicate when moments of kindness occur.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.485
For young children, it helps to have

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:12.072
this consistent visual and audio cue

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:15.867
to remind them of the central themes of compassion that

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:18.912
carries throughout the program.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.580
It's a nice little punctuation there.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.293
Caring heart for your beautiful performance.

00:01:25.293 --> 00:01:28.088
The smallest gesture can really make a big difference.

00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:29.589
Be the person you are.

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:31.633
And be the best version of it that you can be.

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:33.218
And also be kind.

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:34.260
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.305
(SINGING) Shine a light of kindness.

00:01:37.305 --> 00:01:39.724
Start a chain of many more.

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:43.103
[APPLAUSE]

